      en: "Bloger Agency makes blogger advertising «more affordable and simpler»: full-cycle campaigns for brands, and residency for bloggers, where the agency takes care of advertisers and paperwork. Their site does have prices, but they are hidden in the PDF of the commercial offer, the AI assistant block says «Coming soon!», and the number of bloggers in the database differs from page to page: 1700, 2000+ and 2500+. In the mock-up the first screen has two doors, «I'm a brand» and «I'm a blogger», and the camera flies into the letter «O» of BLOGER. The plans from their offer sit on the home page, and a calculator highlights the plan that fits the budget. A catalogue of 64 bloggers from their site: filters by niche and reach, sorting by ER and price per thousand followers, and the shortlist goes to a manager on Telegram as one message. A brand describes the task in a couple of phrases: AI matching picks bloggers from the catalogue, and a brief master sorts the task into fields instead of a long Google Form. For bloggers there is a blog check based on ER and the median price of similar creators, plus a UGC studio: hooks, script and storyboard. A campaign is laid out in eight stages with a sign-off act before each payment.",
